<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Thank you for your continued partnership with National Funding and your recent inquiry for your loan.</font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;">Eligibility Date for Renewal:&nbsp;</span><font face="arial">{!Case.Expected_Renewal_Date__c}</font></div><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">At that time a Renewal Specialist will reach out to you.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><p class="MsoNormal">When paying off your loan early, you will need to wait 30
days before obtaining additional funding from National Funding. <o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal">Please contact our servicing department at 800-294-1702 if
you have further questions.<o:p></o:p></p></div><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Kind Regards,&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial">Payoff Department</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial"><b>National Funding</b></font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}</font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: arial;">P: (800) 294-1702 | F: (888) 279-7564</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: arial;">E: payoff@nationalfunding.com</span></div></div></div></div>]]></td>
